{
  "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
  "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Steven W. Seymour",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0000-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The four doctors who are shareholder-directors of the petitioner are not employees under the ADA, the Americans With Disabilities Act, because, like partners, they own and manage their own clinic."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Steven W. Seymour",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0000-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 5,
        "start": 5
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Because there are frankly not much common law that gives us guidance on how to decide whether a director-shareholder in a professional corporation is an employee or not."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Irving L. Gornstein",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0000-0001",
      "kind": "amicus_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 18,
        "start": 17
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Under the EEOC's guidance, the question whether shareholder-directors are employees depends on whether they operate independently and manage the business or, instead, are subject to the organization's control. That standard aligns the test for determining the employment status of shareholder-directors with the test that courts have long used in deciding whether partners are employees."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0001-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: Neither, all right. Then write that section of the opinion."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 0.94,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0001-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 25,
        "start": 25
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Respondent",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0001-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 26,
        "start": 26
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The position of the clinic and the Government in this case essentially is to look to ignore the form and structure of the corporate business, yet just 2 years ago, in Cedric Kushner versus King, this Court held that a sole shareholder was separate and distinct from the corporate structure itself, and that's the -- the essence of the question."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioner",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 0.91,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0001-0004",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 27,
        "start": 27
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The defense position was, they are, in fact, the same identity, and this Court said no, that's not true. What -- the corporate structure is something separate and distinct, which is recognized by this Court, has been recognized for years and years and years, and that that is something that cannot and should not be ignored."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Crispin",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0001-0005",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 36,
        "start": 36
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "If they know they're not protected, they don't bring the claim."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0002-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 38,
        "start": 38
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: Are you making a distinction between owner-directors who are also working every day providing the services of the entity, and owner-directors who are not involved in the day-to-day service delivery function of the enterprise?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2002-01-1435",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "3bedd2172453a4a98d6893a53c792d32bf5d929e08b5ff656769219c048bdeb3",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bedd2172453-0002-0002",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 43,
        "start": 43
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The case is submitted."
    }
  ],
